@startuml SD_Voice_CreateOrder
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam maxmessagesize 200
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title SD-Voice: AI-POWERED SPEECH-TO-ORDER\n<size:10>Sistem SIM4LON - Gemini AI Integration</size>

actor "Admin" as Admin
boundary "FloatingVoiceWidget" as FVW
control "useVoiceOrder" as UVO
control "useSpeechRecognition" as USR
boundary "WebSpeechAPI" as WSA
entity "Backend API" as BE
database "Gemini AI" as AI
database "Database" as DB

== 1. Aktivasi Voice Order ==

Admin -> FVW : 1: Klik tombol FAB 🎤
activate FVW

FVW -> UVO : 1.1: startListening()
activate UVO

UVO -> USR : 1.2: startListening()
activate USR

USR -> WSA : 1.2.1: new SpeechRecognition()
activate WSA
WSA --> USR : recognition instance

USR -> WSA : 1.2.2: recognition.start()
WSA -> Admin : 1.2.3: Request izin mikrofon

Admin -> WSA : 1.3: Allow permission
WSA --> USR : Permission granted

USR --> UVO : 1.4: status = "listening"
UVO --> FVW : 1.5: isListening = true
FVW --> Admin : 1.6: UI: Pulsing circles\n"Mendengarkan..."

== 2. Speech Recognition (Real-time) ==

Admin -> WSA : 2: Speak: "Lima puluh tabung\n12 kilo ke Reon"

loop Real-time transcript
    WSA -> WSA : 2.1: Audio processing
    WSA --> USR : 2.2: onResult(interim)
    USR --> UVO : 2.3: interimTranscript update
    note right: liveTranscript =\ntranscript + interimTranscript
    UVO --> FVW : 2.4: Display real-time
    FVW --> Admin : 2.5: "Lima puluh..."
end

WSA --> USR : 2.6: onResult(final)\ntranscript = "lima puluh tabung\n12 kilo ke reon"
deactivate WSA

USR --> UVO : 2.7: transcript final

== 3. Auto-Stop & AI Parsing ==

note over USR : Silence 4 detik\n→ Auto-stop
USR -> UVO : 3.1: onSpeechEnd(transcript)
deactivate USR

UVO -> UVO : 3.2: status = "parsing"
UVO --> FVW : 3.3: Show spinner\n"AI menganalisis..."

UVO -> BE : 3.4: POST /gemini/parse-order\n{ text: "lima puluh..." }
activate BE

BE -> AI : 3.5: Send to Gemini AI
activate AI

AI -> AI : 3.6: NLP Processing:\n- Extract quantity: 50\n- Extract product: 12kg\n- Match pangkalan: "Reon"

AI --> BE : 3.7: ParsedOrderData
note right of AI
  {
    pangkalanName: "Reon",
    items: [{
      productName: "LPG 12kg",
      quantity: 50,
      lpgType: "kg12"
    }],
    confidence: 0.92
  }
end note
deactivate AI

== 4. Fuzzy Matching & Validation ==

BE -> DB : 4.1: Find pangkalan by name
note right: Levenshtein fuzzy match\n"reon" → "Reon" (93%)

DB --> BE : pangkalan_id, name

BE -> DB : 4.2: Get product info
DB --> BE : product_id, price

BE -> DB : 4.3: Check stock\n(by lpg_product_id)
DB --> BE : currentStock = 130

BE -> BE : 4.4: Validate:\n✓ Pangkalan aktif\n✓ Stok cukup\n✓ Quantity valid

BE --> UVO : 4.5: GeminiParseResult\n{ success: true, validation: { isValid: true } }
deactivate BE

== 5. Konfirmasi User ==

UVO -> UVO : 5.1: status = "confirming"
UVO --> FVW : 5.2: Show confirmation card
activate FVW

FVW --> Admin : 5.3: Display parsed result:\n- Pangkalan: Reon\n- 50x LPG 12kg\n- Total: Rp xxx\n[Batal] [Konfirmasi]

Admin -> FVW : 6: Klik "Konfirmasi"

FVW -> UVO : 6.1: confirmAndCreate()

== 6. Create Order ==

UVO -> UVO : 6.2: status = "creating"
UVO --> FVW : 6.3: Show "Membuat pesanan..."

UVO -> BE : 6.4: POST /orders/create
activate BE

BE -> DB : 6.5: Create order
DB --> BE : order_id, code

BE -> DB : 6.6: Create order_items
BE -> DB : 6.7: Create timeline_track
BE -> DB : 6.8: Log activity

BE --> UVO : 6.9: { success: true, orderCode: "ORD-0123" }
deactivate BE

== 7. Success ==

UVO -> UVO : 7.1: status = "success"
UVO --> FVW : 7.2: Show success message

FVW --> Admin : 7.3: "✓ Pesanan ORD-0123\nberhasil dibuat!"

Admin -> FVW : 8: Klik "Lihat Pesanan"
FVW -> FVW : 8.1: Navigate to /pesanan/ORD-0123

deactivate FVW
deactivate UVO

note over AI
  <b>AI Technology Stack:</b>
  - Google Gemini API
  - Levenshtein Fuzzy Matching
  - Web Speech API (Chrome/Edge)
end note

@enduml
